---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Product Description Writing Services | Top League',
  description:
    'Persuasive, research-driven and SEO-friendly product descriptions that help shoppers understand your products and feel confident buying them.',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata} pageClass="product-description-page">
  <div class="pdw-page" id="top">
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="pdw-hero">
      <div class="pdw-wrap">
        <nav class="pdw-anchor-nav" aria-label="On this page">
          <a href="#why">Why it matters</a>
          <a href="#difference">Our approach</a>
          <a href="#process">How we work</a>
          <a href="#packages">Packages</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="pdw-eyebrow">Product description writing</div>
        <h1>
          Your product deserves more than a description.
          <em>It deserves to be chosen.</em>
        </h1>
        <p class="pdw-lead">
          We turn product features into meaningful reasons to buy, with persuasive,
          research-driven and SEO-friendly product descriptions.
        </p>
        <div class="pdw-actions">
          <a class="pdw-btn" href="#contact">Request a free sample <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="pdw-btn pdw-btn-outline" href="#why">See what’s included <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <p class="pdw-hero-note">No obligation. Just good product writing for you to evaluate.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WHY IT MATTERS -->
    <section class="pdw-section" id="why">
      <div class="pdw-wrap">
        <div class="pdw-section-head">
          <div class="pdw-eyebrow">Why it matters</div>
          <h2>Good product descriptions do more than describe. They make the value obvious.</h2>
          <p class="pdw-lead">
            The right words connect what a product does with what a customer actually cares about.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pdw-cards pdw-cards-three">
          <article class="pdw-card">
            <div class="pdw-number">01 <span>— PERSUASION</span></div>
            <h3>Features need meaning</h3>
            <p>Features tell shoppers what a product has. Benefits help them understand what it can do for them. We bring the two together through clear, compelling writing.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="pdw-card">
            <div class="pdw-number">02 <span>— CUSTOMER</span></div>
            <h3>Buyers need answers</h3>
            <p>We consider your target audience, their priorities and the questions they’re likely to ask before putting words on the page.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="pdw-card">
            <div class="pdw-number">03 <span>— DISCOVERY</span></div>
            <h3>Products need to be found</h3>
            <p>We incorporate relevant search keywords naturally, without compromising readability or turning your descriptions into keyword lists.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- THE SHOPPING MOMENT -->
    <section class="pdw-section pdw-soft" id="story">
      <div class="pdw-wrap pdw-story">
        <aside class="pdw-story-aside">
          <div class="pdw-eyebrow">A familiar shopping moment</div>
          <div class="pdw-story-index" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
        </aside>
        <div class="pdw-story-copy">
          <h2>Someone is interested in your product. But are they convinced?</h2>
          <p>Imagine someone browsing your online store.</p>
          <p>They find a product that looks promising. The photographs are appealing. The price seems reasonable. They scroll down to learn a little more.</p>
          <p>And then they find a description that tells them almost nothing.</p>
          <p>A list of specifications. A few generic sentences. Perhaps some technical details copied straight from the manufacturer’s catalogue.</p>
          <p>The shopper still has questions. Will it solve their problem? Is it worth the price? What makes it different from the dozens of alternatives available online?</p>
          <p>They hesitate. They open another tab. And your product becomes just another option they considered.</p>
          <p class="pdw-pivot">The problem isn’t necessarily your product. Sometimes, it’s the way your product is presented.</p>
          <p>A good product description closes that gap. It helps shoppers understand what they’re looking at, imagine how it fits into their lives and recognise why it might be the right choice.</p>
          <p><strong>That’s what we believe product writing should accomplish.</strong></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- THE TOP LEAGUE APPROACH -->
    <section class="pdw-section" id="difference">
      <div class="pdw-wrap">
        <div class="pdw-section-head">
          <div class="pdw-eyebrow">The Top League approach</div>
          <h2>Your product may be excellent. Your description should make that obvious.</h2>
          <p class="pdw-lead">Effective product copy doesn’t need to be complicated. It needs to communicate the right things in the right way.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pdw-difference">
          <article class="pdw-difference-card">
            <div class="pdw-eyebrow">× The usual way</div>
            <h3>Descriptions that get in the way</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Long lists of unexplained specifications</li>
              <li>Generic claims that could describe any product</li>
              <li>Keyword-heavy sentences that are hard to read</li>
              <li>Pushy language and exaggerated promises</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
          <article class="pdw-difference-card pdw-difference-card-dark">
            <div class="pdw-eyebrow">✓ The Top League approach</div>
            <h3>Copy that helps customers decide</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Clear information that answers real questions</li>
              <li>Meaningful benefits connected to product features</li>
              <li>Natural keywords and readable copy</li>
              <li>Persuasion grounded in the product’s actual value</li>
            </ul>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HOW WE WORK -->
    <section class="pdw-section pdw-soft" id="process">
      <div class="pdw-wrap">
        <div class="pdw-section-head">
          <div class="pdw-eyebrow">How we work</div>
          <h2>Before we write about your product, we need to understand it.</h2>
          <p class="pdw-lead">Good product descriptions don’t begin with a writing template. They begin with understanding.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pdw-steps">
          <article class="pdw-step">
            <div class="pdw-number">STEP 01</div>
            <h3>Understand the product</h3>
            <p>We examine its features, specifications, intended uses and distinguishing qualities. We identify what a prospective customer needs to know.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="pdw-step">
            <div class="pdw-number">STEP 02</div>
            <h3>Understand the buyer</h3>
            <p>Who is likely to purchase this product? What matters to them? What concerns might prevent them from buying?</p>
          </article>
          <article class="pdw-step">
            <div class="pdw-number">STEP 03</div>
            <h3>Find the right words</h3>
            <p>We identify relevant keywords and translate product information into clear, benefit-oriented language.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="pdw-step">
            <div class="pdw-number">STEP 04</div>
            <h3>Write, review and refine</h3>
            <p>We review the copy for clarity, accuracy, readability and SEO considerations before delivery.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WHAT'S INCLUDED -->
    <section class="pdw-section" id="included">
      <div class="pdw-wrap">
        <div class="pdw-section-head">
          <div class="pdw-eyebrow">What’s included</div>
          <h2>Everything your product page needs to make a stronger impression.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="pdw-cards pdw-cards-four">
          <article class="pdw-card">
            <div class="pdw-number">04 <span>— SEARCH</span></div>
            <h3>SEO titles and meta descriptions</h3>
            <p>We provide SEO titles and meta descriptions alongside your product descriptions, helping each product page make a stronger first impression in search.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="pdw-card">
            <div class="pdw-number">05 <span>— CONSISTENCY</span></div>
            <h3>A consistent catalogue</h3>
            <p>Whether you have a handful of products or hundreds, your catalogue should communicate a consistent brand personality.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="pdw-card">
            <div class="pdw-number">06 <span>— BULK VALUE</span></div>
            <h3>Better value on bulk orders</h3>
            <p>Have a large catalogue to populate? Ask us about volume-based pricing for qualifying bulk orders.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="pdw-card">
            <div class="pdw-number">07 <span>— FREE SAMPLE</span></div>
            <h3>Try before you commit</h3>
            <p>Not sure whether our writing is right for your business? Get in touch to discuss a sample before choosing a package.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PACKAGES -->
    <section class="pdw-section pdw-soft" id="packages">
      <div class="pdw-wrap">
        <div class="pdw-pricing-head">
          <div class="pdw-section-head">
            <div class="pdw-eyebrow">Writing packages</div>
            <h2>Start small. Scale when you’re ready.</h2>
            <p class="pdw-lead">Whether you’re testing the waters or building an entire catalogue, there’s a package to get you moving.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="pdw-side-note">Need a larger order? <a href="#contact">Talk to us about bulk pricing.</a></p>
        </div>

        <div class="pdw-pricing-grid">
          <article class="pdw-price-card">
            <div class="pdw-tier">Basic</div>
            <h3>A practical starting point</h3>
            <p>For businesses looking to experience our product description writing before placing a larger order.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Product-focused descriptions</li>
              <li>Research-led writing</li>
              <li>SEO-aware copy</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="pdw-btn pdw-btn-dark" href="#contact">Discuss your requirements ↗</a>
          </article>
          <article class="pdw-price-card pdw-price-popular">
            <div class="pdw-tier">Standard</div>
            <h3>For growing catalogues</h3>
            <p>For online stores improving product content across a growing catalogue.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Consistent catalogue voice</li>
              <li>Product and audience research</li>
              <li>SEO titles and meta descriptions</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="pdw-btn pdw-btn-dark" href="#contact">Discuss your requirements ↗</a>
          </article>
          <article class="pdw-price-card">
            <div class="pdw-tier">Premium</div>
            <h3>For larger catalogues</h3>
            <p>For businesses with substantial product ranges that need consistent descriptions at scale.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Bulk-order planning</li>
              <li>Consistent writing standards</li>
              <li>Volume-based pricing</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="pdw-btn pdw-btn-dark" href="#contact">Discuss your requirements ↗</a>
          </article>
        </div>
        <p class="pdw-fine">Package scope and pricing depend on product volume, research requirements and the information supplied. Contact us for a quote.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FINAL CTA -->
    <section class="pdw-cta" id="contact">
      <div class="pdw-wrap">
        <div class="pdw-eyebrow">Let’s talk</div>
        <h2>Your products are ready to be discovered. Let’s give people a reason to choose them.</h2>
        <p class="pdw-lead">You’ve already invested in your products, your store and the experience you want to offer customers. Don’t let an overlooked product description become the weakest link.</p>
        <a class="pdw-btn" href="mailto:hello@topleaguetech.com?subject=Product%20description%20writing%20sample">Request your free sample <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <p class="pdw-cta-note">No obligation. Just good product writing for you to evaluate.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

  <footer slot="footer" class="pdw-footer">
    <div class="pdw-wrap">
      <span>© Top League Technologies Pvt. Ltd.</span>
      <span>Product description writing · Bhubaneswar, India</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <style>
    :global(html) { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    /* Keep the existing AstroWindy site header, but visually connect it to this page's hero. */
    :global(body.product-description-page #header) {
      color: #fff;
      background: #17242b !important;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 12%);
    }
    :global(body.product-description-page #header > div:first-child),
    :global(body.product-description-page #header.scroll > div:first-child) {
      background: #17242b !important;
      box-shadow: none !important;
      backdrop-filter: none !important;
    }
    :global(body.product-description-page #header a),
    :global(body.product-description-page #header button) { color: #e1e7e7 !important; }
    :global(body.product-description-page #header a:hover) { color: #fff !important; }
    :global(body.product-description-page #header .text-gray-900) { color: #fff !important; }

    .pdw-page {
      --pdw-ink: #17242b;
      --pdw-muted: #647178;
      --pdw-paper: #fff;
      --pdw-soft: #f5f7f7;
      --pdw-line: #e2e8e8;
      --pdw-accent: #b34a43;
      width: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--pdw-paper);
      color: var(--pdw-ink);
      font-family: Inter, var(--aw-font-sans, Arial), sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .pdw-page *, .pdw-page *::before, .pdw-page *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    .pdw-page h1, .pdw-page h2, .pdw-page h3, .pdw-page p { margin-top: 0; }
    .pdw-page h1, .pdw-page h2, .pdw-page h3 {
      color: inherit;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.14;
      letter-spacing: -.045em;
    }
    .pdw-wrap { width: calc(100% - 48px); max-width: 1160px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .pdw-eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: var(--pdw-accent);
      font-size: .76rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      line-height: 1.4;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .pdw-lead { max-width: 720px; color: var(--pdw-muted); font-size: clamp(1.03rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem); line-height: 1.65; }

    .pdw-hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: clamp(76px, 9vw, 112px) 0 82px;
      background: linear-gradient(110deg, #17242b 0%, #26383f 65%, #34484e 100%);
      color: #fff;
    }
    .pdw-hero::after {
      position: absolute;
      top: 80px;
      right: -160px;
      width: 560px;
      height: 560px;
      border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 8%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 65px rgb(255 255 255 / 4%), 0 0 0 130px rgb(255 255 255 / 2.5%);
      content: '';
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .pdw-hero .pdw-wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .pdw-anchor-nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 24px;
      margin: 0 0 48px;
      padding-bottom: 17px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 16%);
      color: #d1dddd;
      font-size: .78rem;
    }
    .pdw-anchor-nav a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s ease; }
    .pdw-anchor-nav a:hover { color: #fff; }
    .pdw-hero .pdw-eyebrow { color: #f0a197; }
    .pdw-hero h1 {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 18px 0 22px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5.6vw, 5.3rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.04;
      letter-spacing: -.06em;
    }
    .pdw-hero h1 em { color: #f0a197; font-style: normal; }
    .pdw-hero .pdw-lead { max-width: 690px; color: #d3dddd; }
    .pdw-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; }
    .pdw-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      min-height: 48px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border: 1px solid var(--pdw-accent);
      border-radius: 2px;
      background: var(--pdw-accent);
      color: #fff !important;
      font-size: .88rem;
      font-weight: 750;
      line-height: 1.3;
      text-decoration: none !important;
      transition: background .2s ease, border-color .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
    }
    .pdw-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: #963d37; background: #963d37; }
    .pdw-btn-outline { border-color: rgb(255 255 255 / 50%); background: transparent; color: #fff !important; }
    .pdw-btn-outline:hover { border-color: #fff; background: rgb(255 255 255 / 10%); }
    .pdw-hero-note { margin: 18px 0 0; color: #b8c5c5; font-size: .8rem; }

    .pdw-section { padding: 94px 0; background: var(--pdw-paper); scroll-margin-top: 88px; }
    .pdw-soft { background: var(--pdw-soft); }
    .pdw-section-head { max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 42px; }
    .pdw-section-head h2 { margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); }
    .pdw-section-head .pdw-lead { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .pdw-cards { display: grid; gap: 18px; }
    .pdw-cards-three { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .pdw-cards-four { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .pdw-card {
      min-height: 220px;
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--pdw-line);
      background: var(--pdw-paper);
    }
    .pdw-number {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      color: var(--pdw-accent);
      font-size: .75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
    }
    .pdw-number span { color: var(--pdw-muted); }
    .pdw-card h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.3rem; }
    .pdw-card p { margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--pdw-muted); font-size: .93rem; line-height: 1.65; }

    .pdw-story { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .72fr 1.28fr; gap: 9%; align-items: start; }
    .pdw-story-aside { padding-top: 10px; }
    .pdw-story-index { color: #e4eaea; font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 7rem); font-weight: 850; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.09em; }
    .pdw-story-copy { max-width: 740px; }
    .pdw-story-copy h2 { margin-bottom: 28px; font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 3.7vw, 3.25rem); }
    .pdw-story-copy p { margin-bottom: 18px; color: #58666c; }
    .pdw-story-copy strong { color: var(--pdw-ink); }
    .pdw-story-copy .pdw-pivot {
      margin: 30px 0;
      color: var(--pdw-ink);
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.8vw, 2.4rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1.25;
      letter-spacing: -.045em;
    }

    .pdw-difference { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
    .pdw-difference-card { padding: 32px; border: 1px solid var(--pdw-line); background: #fff; }
    .pdw-difference-card .pdw-eyebrow { color: #a34b45; }
    .pdw-difference-card h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.65rem; }
    .pdw-difference-card ul { margin: 16px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; color: var(--pdw-muted); }
    .pdw-difference-card li { padding: 5px 0; }
    .pdw-difference-card-dark { border-color: #17242b; background: #17242b; color: #fff; }
    .pdw-difference-card-dark .pdw-eyebrow { color: #f0a197; }
    .pdw-difference-card-dark ul { color: #d3dddd; }

    .pdw-steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
    .pdw-step { padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #bfcaca; }
    .pdw-step .pdw-number { margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .pdw-step h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.25rem; }
    .pdw-step p { margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--pdw-muted); font-size: .92rem; }

    .pdw-pricing-head { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 25px; margin-bottom: 38px; }
    .pdw-pricing-head .pdw-section-head { margin: 0; }
    .pdw-side-note { max-width: 300px; margin: 0 0 5px; color: var(--pdw-muted); font-size: .9rem; }
    .pdw-side-note a { color: var(--pdw-accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
    .pdw-pricing-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px; align-items: stretch; }
    .pdw-price-card {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      min-height: 390px;
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 30px;
      border: 1px solid var(--pdw-line);
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--pdw-ink);
    }
    .pdw-price-popular { border: 2px solid var(--pdw-accent); }
    .pdw-tier { color: var(--pdw-accent); font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .pdw-price-card h3 { margin: 13px 0; font-size: 1.65rem; }
    .pdw-price-card > p { color: var(--pdw-muted); font-size: .9rem; }
    .pdw-price-card ul { margin: 8px 0 24px; padding: 18px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--pdw-line); color: #526067; font-size: .9rem; list-style: none; }
    .pdw-price-card li { padding: 4px 0; }
    .pdw-price-card li::before { margin-right: 10px; color: var(--pdw-accent); content: '✓'; font-weight: 850; }
    .pdw-btn-dark { margin-top: auto; border-color: var(--pdw-ink); background: var(--pdw-ink); }
    .pdw-btn-dark:hover { border-color: #34484e; background: #34484e; }
    .pdw-fine { margin: 18px 0 0; color: var(--pdw-muted); font-size: .8rem; }

    .pdw-cta { scroll-margin-top: 88px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 92px 0; background: #17242b; color: #fff; text-align: center; }
    .pdw-cta::before {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -320px;
      left: -180px;
      width: 500px;
      height: 500px;
      border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 8%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 55px rgb(255 255 255 / 4%), 0 0 0 110px rgb(255 255 255 / 2.5%);
      content: '';
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .pdw-cta .pdw-wrap { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .pdw-cta .pdw-btn { display: table; width: auto; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 auto; }
    .pdw-cta .pdw-eyebrow { color: #f0a197; }
    .pdw-cta h2 { max-width: 850px; margin: 18px auto 20px; color: #fff; font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); }
    .pdw-cta .pdw-lead { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 28px; color: #c8d3d3; }
    .pdw-cta-note { margin: 16px 0 0; color: #b8c5c5; font-size: .8rem; }
    .pdw-footer { padding: 25px 0; background: #111b20; color: #aab8b9; font-size: .78rem; }
    .pdw-footer .pdw-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 15px; }

    :global(.dark) .pdw-page {
      --pdw-ink: #edf3f3;
      --pdw-muted: #aab8bd;
      --pdw-paper: #10191d;
      --pdw-soft: #172328;
      --pdw-line: #304047;
    }
    :global(.dark) .pdw-story-index { color: #26373d; }
    :global(.dark) .pdw-story-copy p { color: #b4c0c3; }
    :global(.dark) .pdw-story-copy strong { color: #fff; }
    :global(.dark) .pdw-story-copy .pdw-pivot { color: #fff; }
    :global(.dark) .pdw-card { background: #172328; }
